            <p class="ebook-meta-row"><span class="eyebrow">For</span> Pastors, teachers, and Christians who want to grow.</p>
            <p class="ebook-meta-row"><span class="eyebrow">Cost</span> Free with a Mere Orthodoxy subscription.</p>
